      "trackName": "Hangman Wear - Watch Game",
      "description": "Train your brain on the go with this classic word puzzle!\n\nDesigned specifically for the Apple Watch, this violence-free Hangman game uses battery-saving dark themes so you can play longer without draining your device. Every challenge features carefully selected 5-letter words, making it the perfect quick mental workout for any spare moment.\n\nFeatures:\n- 3 Difficulty Levels:\n- Easy: 9 attempts to guess the word.\n- Normal: 7 attempts to guess the word.\n- Hard: 5 attempts to guess the word.\n- Play in 3 Languages: Expand your vocabulary in English, Spanish, and German.\n- Apple Watch Optimized: Fast loading, intuitive interface, and dark mode to preserve battery life.",
